  <name>AbdoPS5</name>
  <summary>PlayStation 5 emulator</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      AbdoPS5 is an experimental PlayStation 5 emulator for PC. It aims to
      emulate the PS5's AMD RDNA2 GPU, AMD Zen 2 CPU, and system firmware
      to run PS5 games on Windows and Linux.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features include a Qt6 launcher with grid/list views, per-game
      configuration, PKG extraction, IOMMU and TMR hardware modeling,
      shader opcode tracking, DualSense haptics support, and more.
    </p>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/OGKushhh/AbdoPS5</url>
